content.text:
Add subtle logo animation maybe after menu-fade keyframes. Could add `logoGlitch` to `.logo .main`, but continuous may be annoying. Add a slow `logo-breathe` drop-shadow. Use `animation: logo-breathe 6s ease-in-out infinite;` but it also has filter with drop-shadow. Animate opacity/filter. Hmm. Add to `.logo .sub` a flicker:
```
.logo .sub { animation: sign-flicker 7s infinite; }
@keyframes sign-flicker { 0,93,100% opacity1; 94% opacity .55; 95% opacity 1; 96% .7; }
```
But text also has color. Could be atmospheric. Let's add with `will-change`. Keep reduced motion override.

